{"name":"Rattan","hex":"#a58e61","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Rattan","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Rattan"}],"entries":[{"title":"Rattan","blocks":[{"text":"Rattan, also spelled ratan, is the name for roughly 600 species of Old World climbing palms belonging to subfamily Calamoideae. The greatest diversity of rattan palm species and genera are in the closed-canopy old-growth tropical forests of Southeast Asia, though they can also be found in other parts of tropical Asia and Africa. Most rattan palms are ecologically considered lianas due to their climbing habits, unlike other palm species. A few species also have tree-like or shrub-like habits."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Thatiyan_Cuural_%28Malayalam-_%E0%B4%A4%E0%B4%9F%E0%B4%BF%E0%B4%AF%E0%B4%A8%E0%B5%8D%E2%80%8D_%E0%B4%9A%E0%B5%82%E0%B4%B0%E0%B4%B2%E0%B5%8D%E2%80%8D%29_%285661614812%29.jpg/330px-Thatiyan_Cuural_%28Malayalam-_%E0%B4%A4%E0%B4%9F%E0%B4%BF%E0%B4%AF%E0%B4%A8%E0%B5%8D%E2%80%8D_%E0%B4%9A%E0%B5%82%E0%B4%B0%E0%B4%B2%E0%B5%8D%E2%80%8D%29_%285661614812%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rattan"},{"title":"Rattan (Chinese TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Rattan is a 2021 Chinese television series based on the web novel with the same title by Wei Yu. Directed by Li Muge, it stars Jing Tian and Zhang Binbin. It aired in Youku, WeTV, and iQIYI from 8 March 2021 until 4 April 2021 every Sundays, Mondays, Tuesdays, and Wednesdays at 20:00 for 30 episodes. It started production since 2020.\n|-\n|}"}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/03/Rattan_%28Chinese_TV_series%29_official_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rattan_(Chinese_TV_series)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikime